name: ["Archon of Sun's Grace", 'Audacious Thief', 'Banishing Light', 'Bond of Revival', 'Carnifex Demon', 'Doomed Necromancer', 'Dryad Greenseeker', 'Fanatic of Mogis', 'Gadwick, the Wizened', 'Goblin Oriflamme', 'Lightning Serpent', 'Lightning Strike', 'Pollenbright Druid', 'Prey Upon', 'Scorching Dragonfire', "Serra's Guardian", 'Weight of Memory', 'Woe Strider']
